{"format":1,"seq":149,"writes":[{"type":"entry","value":{"model":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm thinking through the design: adding an optional images processor to ThreadOptions, wiring it into Thread.open so it installs the fit-images extension and builds coding tools with images when provided, and passing it through run.ts setup to the durable extensions too. I'm also weighing whether creating the node photon images processor lazily is cheap enough to always set up, since it spins up a worker thread.\n\nI'm also deciding extension install order — since fit-images rewrites unfitted images for downstream hooks, I should install it before coding tools (which likely have no hooks anyway) so every other extension sees fitted images, and I need to register \"fit-images\" as a reserved extension name in durable-extensions, deriving the name from the extension instance itself.\n\nI'll have run.ts create the images instance and pass it through to both createDurableExtensions and Thread.open so Thread.open conditionally installs createFitImagesExtension when given. Now I'll install it first and run typecheck to catch any breakages.\n\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01Gy7N7iBGso2xbNvp84NG56","name":"typescript","arguments":{"code":"// @pit: {\"label\": \"Create branch, install updated deps, update lockfile, typecheck\"}\nasync ({ git: { switchBranch }, shell: { exec } }) => {\n  await switchBranch([\"-c\", \"build/93-pi-1.6.0-pit-0.39.2\"]);\n  const i = await exec(\"npm install --save-exact @earendil-works/chord@1.6.0 @earendil-works/pi-ai@1.6.0 @earendil-works/pi-durable@1.6.0 && npm install --save-dev --save-exact oxfmt@0.80.0 oxlint@1.95.0 oxlint-tsgolint@7.0.2008 && npm install --save-dev knip@^6.48.0 && npm update && npm outdated; git diff --stat\", { timeoutMs: 300000 });\n  const t = await exec(\"npm run typecheck 2>&1 | tail -40\", { timeoutMs: 300000 });\n  return { i: (i.stdout + i.stderr).slice(-3000), t: t.stdout };\n}","timeoutMs":300000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"nvidia","model":"aws/anthropic/bedrock-claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":1286,"cacheRead":56882,"cacheWrite":3010,"totalTokens":61180,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":false},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":862},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1795495642823,"responseId":"msg_bdrk_h5fr66ywvdw3umww2dgoiphuw7lkygroprukp27bphpmuldc7ocq","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":13565,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}],"kind":"pi.assistant","id":59,"conversationId":1,"byTaskId":58}},{"type":"task","value":{"id":58,"conversationId":1,"kind":"pi.generation","version":2,"input":{},"background":false,"abortRequested":false,"state":{"status":"waiting","checkpoint":{"phase":"tools","assistant":59,"tools":[60],"pending":[]},"on":[60],"policy":"allSettled"},"startedAt":1795495642810}},{"type":"task","value":{"id":60,"conversationId":1,"kind":"pi.tool","version":3,"input":{"kind":"model","assistant":59,"callId":"toolu_bdrk_01Gy7N7iBGso2xbNvp84NG56"},"owner":58,"background":false,"abortRequested":false,"state":{"status":"pending","checkpoint":{"phase":"call"}}}},{"type":"document.change","id":2,"content":{"version":3,"kind":"base","value":{"run":{"taskId":58,"inputs":[8],"turns":13,"first":7},"tools":[{"callId":"toolu_bdrk_01Gy7N7iBGso2xbNvp84NG56","name":"typescript","taskId":60,"status":"pending"}]}}},{"type":"document.change","id":4,"content":{"version":1,"kind":"base","value":{"models":{"nvidia/aws/anthropic/bedrock-claude-opus-5-5":{"input":28,"output":7937,"cacheRead":416519,"cacheWrite":59892,"totalTokens":484376,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":false},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":2856}},"tools":{}}}}]}